  {
    "id": "2026-10-28-bedtime",
    "slot": "bedtime",
    "publish_at": "2026-10-28T21:30:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "IMAGE",
    "text": "萬聖節倒數三天，各位的小孩今年要扮什麼？\n留言報裝扮，小鷹用專業眼光評分（評分標準：好不好穿脫、會不會被路人多拍兩張）。\n小鷹今年的提案：扮成「剛睡醒」，零成本，神還原。",
    "image_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/images/2026/1028-bedtime.jpg",
    "image_sha256": "d20c8d27f8ae79d3b24fcf24378c4a2710a206d90da24426c84953b34e06ebe4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
