    "slot": "bedtime",
    "publish_at": "2026-10-30T21:30:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "IMAGE",
    "text": "萬聖節前夕，推車裡突然冒出一隻兔子。\n幫這張圖配一句台詞，小孩的、兔子的、推車的都可以。\n最好笑的那句，小鷹拿去做成下一張梗圖，並標註你。",
    "image_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/images/2026/1030-bedtime.jpg",
    "image_sha256": "f365e3dbe69227d8764f98a78a167e3bdc54274f0e90facf2ea51778ca66cbaa",
    "link": null,
