    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-09-noon-owl-text-11",
    "slot": "noon",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-09T12:00:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "圍兜怎麼配？先看今天吃什麼、去哪裡。\n吃奶、副食品、出門要換的，條數和用法不一樣。\n先問家裡有幾條、哪一種最快用完，紗布巾另外算，不用為了湊一套每款都買。\n送禮也先問爸媽：最常缺的是哪一種？",
    "image_url": null,
    "image_sha256": null,
    "video_url": null,
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "彌月禮",
    "self_reply": {
      "text": "延伸看：https://www.ihibou.com/products/hibou-giftbox?utm_source=threads&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=owl_shorts_202611"
    },
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "owl_shorts_batch1_20261105",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "otto",
    "approved_at": "2026-11-05T18:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-11-10-morning-owl-ep02-s1",
    "slot": "morning",
    "publish_at": "2026-11-10T07:30:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "VIDEO",
    "text": "寒流來了，出門前多做一個小檢查。\n先固定，再整理下擺，最後看看寶寶的臉。\n防風罩不能取代推車安全帶，也不能遮住口鼻；下擺還要避開輪子與關節。\n你家出門前，一定會檢查哪一件事？",
